{
  "_doc": [
    "Metalstorm unit -> FX resolution map — the UNIT-side sibling of ",
    "weapon-fx.json. Weapon-fx keys effects off the firing weapon; this file ",
    "keys the effects no weapon owns: unit deaths (squads render-backend ",
    "destroyMember / entity death events), damage-state smoke and fire, and ",
    "movement/ambient emitters consumed by per-unit bindings (fx-offload §2 — ",
    "a unit's bindings.json references these SLOT names via this map instead ",
    "of hardcoding effect names, so class-wide retunes are one edit here).",
    "",
    "Every value is an effect name in effects/library.json (validated by the ",
    "cross-ref check). Slots: death, damageSmoke (health<0.5), ",
    "damageSmokeHeavy (health<0.25), burning (health<0.1 / wreck), moveDust ",
    "(MOVING, rateScale velocity), contactPlant (onContactPlant — gait-phase ",
    "foot plants, PLAN-metalstorm-flow §4), wake (ships MOVING), thruster ",
    "(aircraft engine), buildFx (engineer constructing). null = none.",
    "",
    "Resolution order (mirrors weapon-fx.json): exact `units[<def>]` entry -> ",
    "`scaleOverrides[<class>][<scale>]` -> `byClass[<class>]`. Class and scale ",
    "parse from the def-name convention ms_<class>_s<n> (units/_builder.lua); ",
    "buildings and other non-conforming defs get exact `units` entries when ",
    "their final def names land (buildings_* class keys below cover the ",
    "builder-generated ones)."
  ],
  "version": 1,

  "byClass": {
